# A gantt chart's diagram panel takes the window's width, as Typora's
# does at the top level while the sidebar is closed, and Mermaid draws
# the chart to it; with the sidebar open it keeps the column's.
type ```mermaid\ngantt\nsection A\nTask :a1, 2024-01-01, 3d
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.gantt && view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.width > view.itemAt(0).body.width
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.good !== ""
shot @DIR@/open.png
key Down
type after
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(0).body.folded && view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.width > view.itemAt(0).body.width
shot @DIR@/folded.png
eval Ui.sidebar = true
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.width === view.itemAt(0).body.width
dump @OUT@
